msgstr "当素材板不带镜头数据，或镜头设置为手动时使用的焦距"

#: plateline_light/core.py:478
msgid "Frame the first clip starts on. Used by Manual placement, and as the starting point when the timeline is empty"
msgstr "第一个片段开始的帧。用于手动放置，并在时间线为空时作为起始点"

