msgid "Name of the collection to put the cameras in. An existing one with this name is reused, so importing twice does not split the shots across two collections"
msgstr "用于放置摄像机的集合名称。若已存在同名集合则复用，因此导入两次不会把镜头拆分到两个集合中"

