msgstr "Plateline"

#: plateline_light/core.py:542
msgid "Put the new cameras in their own collection, so the whole shot list can be selected or hidden in one click"
msgstr "将新摄像机放入独立集合，以便一键选中或隐藏整个镜头列表"

#: plateline_light/core.py:504
msgid "Read the lens from the plate when it carries one, otherwise use the value below"
msgstr "当素材板带有镜头数据时从中读取焦距，否则使用下方数值"

